# Templates

**Source of truth:** for current JSON templates / template structure syntax/APIs query `shopify-dev-mcp` (`learn_shopify_api` → `search_docs_chunks`). This file covers only Foundation-specific conventions.

## Alternate templates

- Alternate templates must be named `template-name.suffix.json` (suffix between the base name and `.json`), e.g. `product.quick-shop.json`, `page.styleguide.json`.
- The suffix is the merchant-selectable template; match an existing base template's section structure unless the alternate intentionally diverges.

See [schemas.mdc](schemas.mdc) for section/block schema conventions.
